#: bionics.json
msgid "Sandevistan Mk.1"
msgstr "Sandevistan Mk.1"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sandevistan Mk.1'}
#: bionics.json
msgid ""
"A civilian-grade speedware unit grafted along your spine.  When engaged it "
"floods your nervous system with synthetic signal boosters: your speed rises "
"sharply, the world around you slows, and your vision turns a flat green.  "
"Running it builds heat in the spinal housing and drains bionic power with "
"every move.  Let it overheat and it shuts itself down, taking a piece of you"
" with it."
msgstr ""
"Una unidad de speedware civil injertada a lo largo de tu columna.  Al "
"activarla, inunda tu sistema nervioso con potenciadores de señal sintéticos:"
" tu velocidad aumenta bruscamente, el mundo a tu alrededor se ralentiza y tu"
" visión se vuelve de un verde plano.  Su funcionamiento calienta la carcasa "
"espinal y consume energía biónica con cada movimiento.  Si dejas que se "
"sobrecaliente, se apaga sola y se lleva un pedazo de ti."

#: bionics.json
msgid "Military Sandevistan"
msgstr "Sandevistan militar"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Military Sandevistan'}
#: bionics.json
msgid ""
"A military prototype speedware spine, far beyond anything sold on the "
"street.  When engaged, everything around you all but stops: bullets hang in "
"the air, monsters freeze mid-step, and you move through it trailing "
"afterimages in every color of the spectrum.  It runs hot, very hot, and it "
"drinks bionic power with every move you make.  Overheat it and the shutdown "
"is brutal."
msgstr ""
"Un prototipo militar de columna speedware, muy superior a cualquier cosa que"
" se venda en la calle.  Al activarlo, todo a tu alrededor casi se detiene: "
"las balas quedan suspendidas en el aire, los monstruos se congelan a medio "
"paso y tú te mueves entre todo ello dejando imágenes residuales de todos los"
" colores del espectro.  Se calienta, muchísimo, y bebe energía biónica con "
"cada movimiento que haces.  Si lo sobrecalientas, el apagado será brutal."

#: effects.json
msgid "Sandevistan engaged"
msgstr "Sandevistan activado"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Sandevistan engaged'.
#: effects.json
msgid "The world crawls by in a flat green haze.  Everything is so slow."
msgstr ""
"El mundo se arrastra en una neblina verde y plana.  Todo es tan lento."

#: effects.json
msgid "Spine warm"
msgstr "Columna tibia"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Spine warm'.
#: effects.json
msgid "Your Sandevistan housing is warming up."
msgstr "La carcasa de tu Sandevistan se está calentando."

#: effects.json
msgid "Spine hot"
msgstr "Columna caliente"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Spine hot'.
#: effects.json
msgid "Your spine burns.  The Sandevistan is close to its limit."
msgstr "Tu columna arde.  El Sandevistan está cerca de su límite."

#: effects.json
msgid "Spine CRITICAL"
msgstr "Columna CRÍTICA"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Spine CRITICAL'.
#: effects.json
msgid "Your vision swims and your teeth ache.  Shut it down NOW."
msgstr "Tu visión se nubla y te duelen los dientes.  Apágalo YA."

#: effects.json
msgid "Sandevistan cooling down"
msgstr "Sandevistan enfriándose"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Sandevistan cooling down'.
#: effects.json
msgid ""
"The heat sinks along your spine tick as they cool.  The Sandevistan will not"
" engage until they do."
msgstr ""
"Los disipadores a lo largo de tu columna crujen al enfriarse.  El "
"Sandevistan no se activará hasta que lo hagan."

#: fields.json
msgid "afterimage"
msgstr "imagen residual"

#: items.json
msgid "Sandevistan Mk.1 CBM"
msgid_plural "Sandevistan Mk.1 CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sandevistan Mk.1"
msgstr[1] "MBC Sandevistan Mk.1"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sandevistan Mk.1 CBM'}
#: items.json
msgid ""
"A civilian-grade spinal speedware unit, still sealed in sterile wrap.  The "
"installation manual covers three pages of warnings about heat and neural "
"strain."
msgstr ""
"Una unidad de speedware espinal civil, todavía sellada en su envoltorio "
"estéril.  El manual de instalación dedica tres páginas a advertencias sobre "
"el calor y la tensión neural."

#: items.json
msgid "Military Sandevistan CBM"
msgid_plural "Military Sandevistan CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sandevistan militar"
msgstr[1] "MBC Sandevistan militar"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Military Sandevistan CBM'}
#: items.json
msgid ""
"A matte-black military speedware spine stamped with serial numbers that have"
" been ground off.  The heat sinks along its length are scorched.  Whoever "
"wore it before you probably did not stop in time."
msgstr ""
"Una columna speedware militar negra mate con los números de serie limados.  "
"Los disipadores a lo largo de ella están chamuscados.  Quien la llevó antes "
"que tú probablemente no paró a tiempo."

#: main.lua
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>SANDEVISTAN OVERHEAT.</color>  The world slams back to full"
" speed."
msgstr ""
"<color_light_red>SOBRECALENTAMIENTO DEL SANDEVISTAN.</color>  El mundo "
"vuelve de golpe a toda velocidad."

#: main.lua
msgid "Blood runs from your nose and the floor tilts under you."
msgstr "La sangre te corre por la nariz y el suelo se inclina bajo tus pies."

#: main.lua
msgid "Your Sandevistan runs out of power and the world snaps back to speed."
msgstr ""
"Tu Sandevistan se queda sin energía y el mundo vuelve de golpe a su "
"velocidad."

#: main.lua
#, c-format
msgid "The Sandevistan refuses to engage: spine at %d%%."
msgstr "El Sandevistan se niega a activarse: columna al %d%%."

#: main.lua
msgid ""
"<color_light_green>Sandevistan engaged.</color>  Everything around you slows"
" to a crawl."
msgstr ""
"<color_light_green>Sandevistan activado.</color>  Todo a tu alrededor se "
"ralentiza hasta arrastrarse."

#: main.lua
msgid "You disengage the Sandevistan.  The world lurches back up to speed."
msgstr ""
"Desactivas el Sandevistan.  El mundo recupera su velocidad de un tirón."

#: main.lua
msgid "ready"
msgstr "listo"

#: main.lua
msgid "COOLING"
msgstr "ENFRIANDO"

#: main.lua
msgid "ENGAGED"
msgstr "ACTIVO"

#: main.lua
#, c-format
msgid "Sandevistan %s: %s"
msgstr "Sandevistan %s: %s"

#: main.lua
#, c-format
msgid "Heat  [%s] %3d%%"
msgstr "Calor   [%s] %3d%%"

#: main.lua
#, c-format
msgid "Power [%s] %4d kJ"
msgstr "Energía [%s] %4d kJ"

#: modinfo.json
msgid "Sandevistan"
msgstr "Sandevistan"

#. ~ Description for Sandevistan
#: modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Adds the Sandevistan: a spinal speedware CBM that slows the world to a "
"crawl.  While it runs your vision turns green, monsters nearly freeze and "
"you leave a trail of rainbow afterimages.  Every move drains bionic power, "
"and pushing it too hard overheats the unit: nosebleed, stun and a forced "
"cooldown.  Both units can be picked at character creation."
msgstr ""
"Añade el Sandevistan: un MBC speedware espinal que ralentiza el mundo hasta "
"arrastrarse.  Mientras funciona, tu visión se vuelve verde, los monstruos "
"casi se congelan y dejas un rastro de imágenes residuales de arcoíris.  Cada"
" movimiento consume energía biónica, y forzarlo demasiado sobrecalienta la "
"unidad: hemorragia nasal, aturdimiento y enfriamiento forzado.  Ambas "
"unidades pueden elegirse al crear el personaje."
